      "text": "No tiny person! Today I'll show you what happens between your question and the answer, step by step.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🔍",
        "text": "Question → ??? → Answer",
        "cue": "question"
      },
      "punch": "step"
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "And why it sometimes gets things wrong?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "That too. We'll cover tokens, training, how answers get written, and the limits. Then a quiz, so pay attention!",
      "board": {
        "type": "gallery",
